sections.text:
Proteam Omega is a giant robot that defends the world. When a crisis occurs, Commander calls his team:
controls Tauri-Plane (Japanese: タウリプレーン), a biplane;
controls Tauri-Liner (Japanese: タウリライナー), a train;
controls Tauri-Ship (Japanese: タウリシップ), a boat;
controls Tauri-Balloon (Japanese: タウリバルーン), a hot air balloon;
controls Tauri-Rescue (Japanese: タウリレスキュー), a fire truck.
When all five unite their vehicles, Proteam Omega is formed. Its antagonist is Demon Brioche (Japanese: デモニッシュ デニッシュ Demonish Danish), known as Devilish Dennis in the Chuang Yi translation.
